// tsconfig.json — the TypeScript surface of this package is scripts/*.ts ONLY.
// The Rust crate is checked by cargo (`check` / `lint:strict` / `test`), so neither it
// nor any generated artifact belongs here. Extends the root config, whose
// `exclude` already drops **/*.test.ts — so `yarn typecheck` covers the production
// scripts and vitest owns the colocated test files.
// Precedent: packages/typecrate/nexus/tsconfig.json (the same shape, and the same
// three-level depth, so the repo-root config is ../../../tsconfig.json). The caveat that
// file records still applies to a standalone checkout of THIS repository: the root config
// and the workspace packages the scripts import (@config/vault, @services/daytona) live
// OUTSIDE it, so `tsc -p .` only resolves inside the noobscript monorepo — which is also
// why .github/workflows/ci.yml runs cargo and nothing else.
{
    "extends": "../../../tsconfig.json",
    "include": ["scripts/**/*.ts"]
}
